Pour trouver le résultat de $10$ multiplié par $7$, on effectue l'opération suivante :
$$ 10 \times 7 = 70 $$

\boxed{70}

When you overtake the person in second place, you take their position. Since they were second and you moved ahead of them, you now occupy that spot. The person who was previously first takes your old place (which was last or third, depending on the context, but certainly behind you).

Therefore, you are in **second** place.

